+```
+
+Recommended rally CSV columns:
+
+```text
+snapshot_time
+symbol
+timeframe
+last_closed_bar_time
+last_closed_bar_price
+scale_L
+direction
+sequence_id
+event_id
+canonical_id
+phase_id
+chain_id
+established_f_level
+probable_next_f_level
+macro_state
+flag_stage
