+```
+
+Recommended hook CSV columns:
+
+```text
+snapshot_time
+symbol
+timeframe
+last_closed_bar_time
+last_closed_bar_price
+scale_L
+hook_id
+sequence_id
+direction
+polarity
+is_nd
+is_open_or_relevant
+latest_confirmed_node_number
+current_node_number
+latest_high_node_id
+latest_high_node_price
